# Index Pages

When editing module index pages:

- **`docs/05-index-pages.md`** — list table + MetricStrip + FilterBar anatomy
- **`docs/06-routing.md`** — row click → customer shell deep links
- **`docs/02-design-system.md`** — table styling (`rounded-3xl`, readable row padding)
- **`docs/08-mock-data.md`** — seed data and session merges

## Key rules

1. Default landing is **list table + metric strip** — not grouped priority buckets.
2. Row clicks navigate to **`/customers/:id?tab=…`** with record params — same customer shell.
3. **Prospects** (`/prospects`) is a live index — new-business queue rows.
4. Contracts index has **no** upload CTA — ingest via Workbench Queue.
5. Queue / Approvals lists live on Workbench tabs — no standalone index pages.
